Rationale: Route eligible collectives through prepared B12X RoCEnante plans and synchronize priming.
Quality and speed: Preserves NCCL fallback and accounts collective memory before KV sizing.
Tests: source replay, syntax parse, and diff check; target hardware qualification pending.
Upstream status: local candidate, not submitted.
